msgstr "Tap to play, or drag with the mouse or a finger"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:573
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Klondike solitaire: put every card on its pile, from the ace to the king, taking one card at a time from the deck. Win fast for a time bonus."
msgstr "Klondike solitaire: put every card on its pile, from the ace to the king, taking one card at a time from the deck. Win fast for a time bonus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:590
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Klondike taking three cards at a time from the deck, where only the top one can be played. More difficult, and closer to the classic game."
msgstr "Klondike taking three cards at a time from the deck, where only the top one can be played. More difficult, and closer to the classic game."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:604
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All the cards face up, and four free cells"
msgstr "All the cards face up, and four free cells"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:606
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "FreeCell: all the cards are face up from the start. Use the four free cells to move cards, and put every card on its pile, from the ace to the king. Win fast for a time bonus."
msgstr "FreeCell : toutes les cartes sont face visible depuis le début. Utilisez les quatre cellules libres pour déplacer les cartes, et mettre chaque carte sur sa pile, de l'as au roi. Gagnez vite pour un bonus de temps."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/games/catalog.ex:654
